#. Tag: para
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog is in essence the same as the <link linkend=\"commands-dialogs-"
"layers-newlayer\">New Layer</link> dialog, with the difference that you "
"cannot change its colorspace or profile anymore. These properties are shown, "
"though, to keep the information complete."
msgstr ""
"ប្រអប់​នេះមាន​សារៈ​សំខាន់​ដូច​ ប្រអប់​ <link linkend=\"commands-dialogs-layers-newlayer"
"\">ស្រទាប់​ថ្មី</link> ជាមួយ​ភាព​ខុសគ្នា​ដែ​ល​អ្នក​មិនអាច​ផ្លាស់ប្តូរ​គំរូពណ៌ និង​ទម្រង់ ។លក្ខណៈ​សម្បត្តិ​ត្រូវ​បាន​"
"បង្ហាញ​ ដើម្បី​រក្សា​ព័ត៌មាន​ទាំងស្រុង ។"

#. Tag: title
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:431
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The <guilabel>Layer Size</guilabel> dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>ប្រអប់​<guilabel>ទំហំ​ស្រទាប់​</guilabel></title>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:435
#, no-c-format
msgid "<screeninfo>The <guilabel>Layer Size</guilabel> dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>ស្រទាប់​<guilabel>ទំហំ​ស្រទាប់​</guilabel></screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:441
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>Layer Size</guilabel> dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>ស្រទាប់​ <guilabel>ទំហំ​</guilabel> ស្រទាប់​</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:443
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>The <guilabel>Layer Size</guilabel> dialog</para>"
msgstr "<para>ប្រអប់​<guilabel>ទំហំ</guilabel> ស្រទាប់​</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:448
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This dialog allows you to resize the current layer. Under <guilabel>Pixel "
"dimensions</guilabel>, you can set which new size you want the layer to "
"have. The original size is given as a reference. The new size can be set "
"both as pixels or as a percentage, with 100% being the original size. If you "
"select <guilabel>Constrain proportions</guilabel>, the new width and height "
"will always be set to the same percentage. For example, if you have a layer "
"of 200 x 100 pixels, and set the width to 20 pixels, the height will "
"automatically be changed to 10. With this checkbox unselected, you can also "
"resize the layer non-proportionally. The <guilabel>Filter</guilabel> "
"dropdown list can be used to select a different algorithm for resizing the "
"layer."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:465
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>The <guilabel>New Adjustment Layer</guilabel> dialog</title>"
msgstr "<title>ប្រអប់​<guilabel>ការ​លៃតម្រូវ​ស្រទាប់​</guilabel>ថ្មី</title>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:469
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<screeninfo>The <guilabel>New Adjustment Layer</guilabel> dialog</screeninfo>"
msgstr "<screeninfo>ប្រអប់​<guilabel>ការ​លៃតម្រូវ​</guilabel>ស្រទាប់​ថ្មី</screeninfo>"

#. Tag: phrase
#: commands-dialogs.docbook:475
#, no-c-format
msgid "<phrase>The <guilabel>New Adjustment Layer</guilabel> dialog</phrase>"
msgstr "<phrase>ប្រអប់​<guilabel>ការ​លៃតម្រូវ​</guilabel>ស្រទាប់​ថ្មី</phrase>"

#. Tag: para
